## Torus with gap - hex sweep mesh (quad surface) for BEM inductance
## Run: playback "inductance_torus_quad.jou"

reset

## Parameters
#{R = 0.05}
#{a = 0.005}
#{gap = 0.005}

## Create torus
create torus major radius {R} minor radius {a}

## Create cutting brick for gap
brick x {3*a} y {gap} z {3*a}
move Volume 2 x {R} y 0 z 0 include_merged

## Subtract to create gap
subtract volume 2 from volume 1

## Hex sweep mesh
volume all scheme sweep
curve all interval 8
mesh volume all

## Allow elements in multiple blocks
set duplicate block elements on

## Register blocks (quad surface elements)
block 1 add volume all
block 1 name "conductor"
block 2 add quad all
block 2 name "boundary"
